# MOE Motion AI — line endings
#
# Host code is ExtendScript (ASCII-only, ES3) and several tests match the
# source text of extension/** with regexes written against "\n" (for example
# tests/control.test.js KEY_REFS, tests/motion.control.test.js,
# tests/toolcards.test.js). A Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true used to
# check files out with CRLF, so those regexes found nothing and `npm run check`
# failed on a fresh clone. Keep every text file LF in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zxp binary
*.exe binary
*.dat binary
